      `the witness is testifying` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 486.1(5) the judge or justice may order that the support person and the witness not communicate with each other while the witness testifies` MEANS
    IF `a support person is permitted for the witness` AND `the witness is testifying`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the support person and the witness not communicate with each other while the witness testifies"

