    IF `the hearing is to determine whether the order should be made`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may hold a hearing to determine whether the order should be made"

-- src:8866 | (3) In determining whether to make the order, the judge or justice shall consider
-- src:8867 | (a) the right to a fair and public hearing;
-- src:8868 | (b) the nature of the offence;
