    `s 486.31(3)(h) whether effective alternatives to the making of the proposed order are available in the circumstances`
    `s 486.31(3)(i) the salutary and deleterious effects of the proposed order`
    `s 486.31(3)(j) any other factor that the judge or justice considers relevant`

